		"description": "<p>With a whispered prayer, your weapon glows red hot. Make an attack with a melee weapon. On a successful attack you deal Basic Melee damage, and your target takes ongoing fire damage equal to your proficiency modifier for a number of turns equal to your Wisdom or Charisma modifier, whichever is higher. Any creature can spend an action to end the ongoing damage early so long as they are within melee range of the burning target.</p>",
